,{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker samples each record after its enrichers and before the consent, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped record is never held, written to a store or delivered. Records a store recovered","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"aren’t sampled again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a drop joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the reports waiting unread are at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most one per event type, however many events are dropped. Copies of a tracker share one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the tracker has finished. A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s is empty."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/samplingDropReports":{"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each event the tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"samplingDropReports","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingDropReports","kind":"